#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Compute the ground state energy of a hydrogen atom with VQE {#compute-the-"
"ground-state-energy-of-a-hydrogen-atom-with-vqe}"
msgstr ""
"Kira tenaga keadaan asas atom hidrogen dengan VQE {#compute-the-ground-"
"state-energy-of-a-hydrogen-atom-with-vqe}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now, let's use what we've learned to compute the ground state energy of a "
"hydrogen atom. Throughout the module, we will use a framework for quantum "
"computing known as \"Qiskit patterns\", which breaks down workflows into the"
" following steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang, mari gunakan apa yang telah kita pelajari untuk mengira tenaga "
"keadaan asas atom hidrogen. Sepanjang modul ini, kita akan menggunakan "
"rangka kerja untuk pengkomputeran kuantum yang dikenali sebagai \"corak "
"Qiskit\", yang membahagikan aliran kerja kepada langkah-langkah berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map classical inputs to a quantum problem\n"
msgstr "Langkah 1: Petakan input klasik kepada masalah kuantum\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Optimize problem for quantum execution\n"
msgstr "Langkah 2: Optimumkan masalah untuk pelaksanaan kuantum\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute using Qiskit Runtime primitives\n"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Jalankan menggunakan primitif Qiskit Runtime\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-processing and classical analysis\n"
msgstr "Langkah 4: Pasca-pemprosesan dan analisis klasik\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Qiskit pattern](/learning/images/modules/computer-"
"science/vqe/patterns.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Corak Qiskit](/learning/images/modules/computer-"
"science/vqe/patterns.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We will generally follow these steps.\n"
msgstr "Kita akan mengikuti langkah-langkah ini secara umum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let's start by loading some necessary packages, including Qiskit Runtime "
"primitives. We will also select the least busy quantum computer available to"
" us.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mari mulakan dengan memuatkan beberapa pakej yang diperlukan, termasuk "
"primitif Qiskit Runtime. Kita juga akan memilih komputer kuantum yang paling"
" tidak sibuk yang tersedia untuk kita.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There is code below for saving your credentials upon first use. Be sure to "
